# Makefile is the public interface

Follow [.agents/skills/makefile-operations/SKILL.md](../../.agents/skills/makefile-operations/SKILL.md).

Never run `uv add`, `uv remove`, `uv lock`, or `uv sync` on the host. Use `make uv-add`, `make uv-remove`, `make uv-lock`, `make lint`, `make test`.

Lifecycle: `make up` / `make down` / `make build` / `make restart` — not `start`/`stop`.
